Greglite — Horizon-native workshop mod (GTM-oriented Steam + Electric Age).

Inspired by GregTech CEu: Modern; not affiliated with GregTech / Gregicality /
GTNH / GTCEu authors. Clean reimplementation for Horizon — not a jar port.

Reference extract (read-only): reference/GregTech-Modern @ 1.20.1
Coverage score: mods/greglite/tracker/coverage.json (weighted checklist).

Textures / GUI
--------------
Selected textures and GUI panels are derived from GregTech CEu: Modern
(https://github.com/GregTechCEu/GregTech-Modern), LGPL-3.0.
See tools/fetch_gtm_textures.py and tools/fetch_gtm_gui.py.

N7 vacuum freezer reuses `ebf_casing` (no separate frost-proof casing yet).
`hot_steel_ingot` reuses the steel ingot texture path as a stand-in.

Original Rust and JSON in this folder: MIT unless noted otherwise.
Minecraft / Mojang assets are not redistributed.
